Update system module with disabled radios and check statuses
    [Arguments]      ${sw_version}
    ...              ${sw_target}
    ...              ${timeout}
    ...              ${connection}
    ...              ${path}

    Robot Log Operation                                   SW Update procedure with system modules check began...

    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer               5min
    ...                                                   5s
    ...                                                   Check Statuses Of All RMODs
    ...                                                   status=disabled

    Download And Update SW                                path=${path}
    ...                                                   sw_version=${sw_version}
    ...                                                   sw_target=${sw_target}
    ...                                                   timeout=${timeout}

    Robot Log Operation                                   Software update completed, waiting for SMODs' online status.

    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer               15min
    ...                                                   10s
    ...                                                   status_check.verify_statuses_of_all_smods
    ...                                                   connection=${connection}
    ...                                                   status_variant=online

    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer               5min
    ...                                                   10s
    ...                                                   status_check.verify_statuses_of_all_bbmods
    ...                                                   connection=${connection}
    ...                                                   status_variant=online

    Robot Log Result                                      msg=All SMODs and BBMODs are online after software update procedure.
    ...                                                   to_console=${True}


Disallow Allarms Before RMODs Power On
    Disallow X2 Link Alarms
    Alarms.Disallow alarm                                 fault_id=23
    ...                                                   fault_name=Incompatible SW version detected


