Teardown
    [Arguments]      ${sw_version}
    ...              ${back_to_basic_sw}
    ...              ${download_path}
    ...              ${bts_type}=GNB

    ${connection}                                         connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    Robot Log Operation                                   Test teardown...

    Disallow Allarms Before RMODs Power On

    logs.download_swdlreport                              local_path=${logs_path}

    Robot Log Operation                                   RU's power on recovery procedure started...
    power.turn_on_all_gnb_rmods
    Alarms.Wait for inactive alarm                        fault_id=10
    ...                                                   timeout=150s
    Robot Log Result                                      msg=RU's power on recovery procedure has finished
    ...                                                   to_console=${True}

    Allow X2 Link Alarms

    ${active_sw_version}  ${passive_sw_version}           sw_update.get_active_and_passive_sw_version

    ${timeout_sw_update_teardown}                         Get Timeout Complete Sw Update

    run keyword if   ${back_to_basic_sw}                  run keyword if
