    ...                                                   sw_version=${sw_version}
    ...                                                   sw_target=basic_sw
    ...                                                   timeout=${timeout_sw_update_teardown}
    ...                                                   path=${download_path}
    ...                                                   connection=${connection}
    ...                                                   bts_type=${bts_type}

    Disallow X2 Link Alarms
    Alarms.Disallow alarm                                 fault_id=2002
    ...                                                   fault_name=Receiving failure in Optical Interface

    Recovery for disallowed alarms in postcondition and fail teardown
    ...                                                   sw_version=${sw_version}
    ...                                                   timeout=2000
    ...                                                   download_path=${download_path}
    ...                                                   connection=${connection}
    ...                                                   bts_type=${bts_type}

Recovery for disallowed alarms in postcondition and fail teardown
    [Arguments]      ${sw_version}
    ...              ${timeout}
    ...              ${download_path}
    ...              ${connection}
    ...              ${bts_type}=GNB

    Robot Log Operation                                   Disallowed alarms recovery as Test Postcondition started...
    ${fault_23}        Alarms.Wait for active alarm       timeout=1min
    ...                                                   fault_id=23
    ${fault_10}        Alarms.Wait for active alarm       timeout=10s
    ...                                                   fault_id=10

    run keyword if  ${fault_23} and '${fault_10}'=='${False}'
    ...                                                   Update SW and wait for OnAir State
    ...                                                   sw_version=${sw_version}
    ...                                                   sw_target=basic_sw
    ...                                                   timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                   path=${download_path}
    ...                                                   connection=${connection}
    ...                                                   bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${bts_download_or_activation_fault}                   Alarms.Is alarm active
    ...                                                   fault_name=BTS SW download or activation failed

    run keyword if  ${bts_download_or_activation_fault}   Perform reset site and Wait for OnAir

    run keyword if  ${fault_23} or ${bts_download_or_activation_fault}
    ...                                                   Fail and show active alarms

Fail and show active alarms
